# Wave T29 (Lilac kit): sunlamp — the second-sun lamp. The town
# sign's own words: "The Game Corner's lights are the second
# sun." A bronze post topped with a glowing sun-orb (pale gold
# halo, bright core) — the Corner's marquee glow carried onto
# the street furniture: a pair flanks the Game Corner's
# frontage, one stands at the great crossing's north-east
# corner, one on the south avenue's shoulder. MARKS OF LIGHT,
# NOT WORDS. FULLY OPAQUE by design: tg-mauville (measured flat
# #1d8713, with its shading derivatives) is baked in as its
# ground, never transparency (the T27/T28 precedent).
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T29-LILAC-PLAN.md.)
PIX tile-prop-sunlamp 16 16
